<title>UK: SOCCER-LEADING SCOTTISH PREMIER DIVISION SCORERS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-LEADING SCOTTISH PREMIER DIVISION SCORERS.</headline>
<dateline>GLASGOW 1996-10-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading goalscorers in the</p>
<p>Scottish premier division after Saturday's matches:</p>
<p>9 - Billy Dodds (Aberdeen)</p>
<p>7 - Pierre Van Hooydonk (Celtic)</p>
<p>6 - Paul Gascoigne (Rangers)</p>
<p>4 - Jorge Cadete (Celtic), Dean Windass (Aberdeen), Ally</p>
<p>McCoist (Rangers), Peter Van Vossen (Rangers),</p>
<p>Gerrard Britton (Dunfermline), Andreas Thom (Celtic),</p>
<p>Gary McSwegan (Dundee United), Paul Wright (Kilmarnock)</p>
